msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "awarenessSubject is functional"
msgstr "awarenessSubject 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:awarenessSubject is functional: each gmeow:AwarenessTenure reifies the awareness state of exactly one bearer agent, so this per-branch subject edge (Principle 4, deliberately not gufo:inheresIn) names a single experiencer for the mode-over-interval it records."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:awarenessSubject 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:AwarenessTenure 恰好具体化一个承载主体的意识状态,因此这条按分支划分的主体边(原则4,刻意区别于 gufo:inheresIn)为其所记录的区间上模式命名了唯一的体验者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:awarenessSubject names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:awarenessSubject 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:awarenessSubject, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:awarenessSubject, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:awarenessSubjectFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:awarenessSubject ."
msgstr "gmeow:awarenessSubjectFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:awarenessSubject ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:awarenessSubject and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:awarenessSubject (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:awarenessSubject 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:awarenessSubject 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "immersive non-lucid dreaming"
msgstr "沉浸式非清醒梦境"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An immersive, non-lucid dreaming mode in which metacognitive awareness of dreaming is not online. It describes the rare, subjectively deeper dream mode without asserting a measured sleep stage."
msgstr "一种沉浸式、非清醒的梦境模式，其中对正在做梦的元认知意识未处于在线状态。它描述罕见且主观上更深的梦境模式，而非断言某个测得的睡眠阶段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:dream gmeow:awarenessMode gmeow:modeImmersiveDreaming ."
msgstr "ex:dream gmeow:awarenessMode gmeow:modeImmersiveDreaming ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A sibling AwarenessMode value, not a subclass or an equivalence to lucid dreaming. Immersion and depth are attributed descriptions; neither biological REM nor a numerical arousal level follows from this value."
msgstr "这是并列的 AwarenessMode 值，而非子类，也不等同于清醒梦。沉浸和深度是归属给某立场的描述；该值不蕴含生物学上的快速眼动睡眠或数值化唤醒水平。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid it when awareness of dreaming is online; that is modeLucidDreaming. Do not use the ambiguous wild-dreaming spelling for this mode."
msgstr "当对做梦的意识在线时不要使用，应使用 modeLucidDreaming。不要对此模式使用含义模糊的 wild-dreaming 名称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach this value through awarenessMode to the dreaming Experience or a scoped awareness record; retain the attributing standpoint instead of claiming a clinical sleep measurement."
msgstr "通过 awarenessMode 将此值附于做梦的 Experience 或有作用域的意识记录；保留作出归属的立场，不将其冒充为临床睡眠测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modeImmersiveDreaming|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a recorded immersive dream with no online metacognition or lucidity, whether the experiencer is human or an artificial agent."
msgstr "用于记录没有在线元认知或清醒意识的沉浸式梦境，无论体验者是人类还是人工代理。"
